<title>USA: Morgan Products Q1 net shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Morgan Products Q1 net shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WILLIAMSBURG, Va. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MORGAN PRODUCTS LTD</p>
<p>						 Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						    (Unaudited)</p>
<p>						Apr 5,		Mar 30,</p>
<p>						 1997		   1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			  $ 95,805,000	 $ 74,536,000</p>
<p>Net (Loss) Income</p>
<p>	(Before special charges)   1,678,000	    (559,000)</p>
<p>Net (Loss) Income</p>
<p>	(After special charges)  (1,932,000)	    (559,000)</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) Per Share</p>
<p>	(Before special charges)	  0.17		 (0.06)</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) Per Share</p>
<p>	(After special charges)	 (0.19)		 (0.06)</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding     10,152,111	    8,647,871</p>
<p>NOTE: The company took a special charge of $2.5 million for expenses related to consolidating its Lexington door operation into a new facility and the late delivery of certain equipment. The company aslo took a special charge of $1.1 million for reorganization related to changes in executive management.</p>
